## Database Setup

### PostgreSQL Setup

{{#if database.prisma}}
#### 1. Create Database

```bash
# If using managed database (Neon, Supabase, Railway)
# Create through their dashboard

# If self-hosted
createdb {{projectName}}_production
```

#### 2. Run Migrations

```bash
# Push schema
DATABASE_URL="your-production-url" pnpm db:push

# Or use migrations
DATABASE_URL="your-production-url" pnpm db:migrate deploy
```

#### 3. Seed Database (Optional)

```bash
DATABASE_URL="your-production-url" pnpm db:seed
```
{{/if}}

### Database Providers

Recommended PostgreSQL providers:

- **[Neon](https://neon.tech)** - Serverless Postgres with generous free tier
- **[Supabase](https://supabase.com)** - Open source Firebase alternative
- **[Railway](https://railway.app)** - Integrated with deployment
- **[PlanetScale](https://planetscale.com)** - MySQL alternative with branching
- **[AWS RDS](https://aws.amazon.com/rds/)** - Enterprise-grade managed database

