## Monitoring & Health Checks

### Health Check Endpoint

Your application includes a comprehensive health check at `/api/health`:

- **200 OK**: All services healthy
- **200 OK (degraded)**: Some non-critical services slow/down
- **503 Service Unavailable**: Critical services down

### Monitoring Setup

#### Uptime Monitoring

```bash
# Example with curl
curl -f https://yourdomain.com/api/health || alert-system
```

#### Log Aggregation

Set up log shipping to:
- Datadog
- New Relic
- Papertrail
- CloudWatch (AWS)
- Stackdriver (GCP)

#### Alerts

Set up alerts for:
- Health check failures
- High error rates
- Slow response times
- Database connection issues
- High memory/CPU usage

